# Terraform working files. State lives in the remote S3 backend (versions.tf) — it
# holds nothing secret here (common has no secrets) but is still remote so both env
# stacks read it. The provider cache and plan files are machine-local. The
# .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed (pinned provider hashes).
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Local var overrides may carry CIDRs/hostnames; keep them out of git.
*.tfvars
!example.tfvars
